 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.6,
   "text": "What is the difference between the people who win and the people who do not?"
  },
  {
   "s": 5.2,
   "e": 10.92,
   "text": "Both tried. Both set out to become something one got there, one did not. Is it willpower,"
  },
  {
   "s": 11.34,
   "e": 15.7,
   "text": "consistency, intelligence, or something none of us saw coming? Look at where we are standing."
  },
  {
   "s": 16.3,
   "e": 20.04,
   "text": "More technology in your hands than any generation has ever had."
  },
  {
   "s": 20.22,
   "e": 23.46,
   "text": "More ways to change something than you could use in a lifetime."
  },
  {
   "s": 24.04,
   "e": 27.08,
   "text": "So the answer is duller than you want it to be."
  },
  {
   "s": 27.08,
   "e": 31.16,
   "text": "You already know you could do it. You just never made a plan."
  },
  {
   "s": 31.8,
   "e": 36.16,
   "text": "You are comfortable enough where you are that getting out of your own way feels like a bother."
  },
  {
   "s": 36.92,
   "e": 40.22,
   "text": "That same story runs through all of history and most of the present."
  },
  {
   "s": 41.04,
   "e": 44.82,
   "text": "The dream stays a dream. We are going to change that."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.54,
   "e": 50.62,
   "text": "The first step has already started. There is now an intent archive where any of us can"
  },
  {
   "s": 50.62,
   "e": 56.06,
   "text": "put a dream into words the whole world can see. So start by owning what you actually want."
  },
  {
   "s": 56.7,
   "e": 59.54,
   "text": "Then phase 2 begins. Shortly."
  },
  {
   "s": 60.52,
   "e": 64.92,
   "text": "Phase 2 is about execution, turning what you wrote into something real."
  },
  {
   "s": 65.62,
   "e": 74.88,
   "text": "If you want to be part of this, the archive is live at www.demure.com. Go take your first action."
  }
